{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Private Witch Eye: The Lotus Killer&quot; is a fantasy adventure that follows the Private Investigator/Witch: Mona. She uses her abilities to solve supernatural crime cases. This case follows the serial killer nicknamed \u201cThe Lotus Killer\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>INVESTIGATE</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/65ed582cc946c6eedef76ab4ba429ee9.poster.avif?t=1759013874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/65ed582cc946c6eedef76ab4ba429ee9.webm?t=1759013874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/65ed582cc946c6eedef76ab4ba429ee9.mp4?t=1759013874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a detective witch who uses her abilities to investigate supernatural crime scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use \u201cPolaroid Dive\u201d to \u201cdive\u201d into crime scenes through polaroid photos provided to you by the police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use \u201cWitch Eye\u201d to see remnants of magic and uncover hidden clues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>EXPLORE</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/b527bb429dbb7a52d25681d150e908c5.poster.avif?t=1759013874\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/b527bb429dbb7a52d25681d150e908c5.webm?t=1759013874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/extras/b527bb429dbb7a52d25681d150e908c5.mp4?t=1759013874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various environments, including past, present &amp; \u201cnot there\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into surreal worlds created from your imagination and inspired by \u201cAlice in Wonderland\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel in between timelines to catch the sadistic serial killer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>UNRAVEL</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the dark story behind the murderer to stop them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery behind this serial killer known as \u201cThe Lotus Killer\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover that you share more similarities with the killer than you initially thought.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057850?t=1759013874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/c13b11264a643c80178d653a358319fc80428c60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759013874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/d39b165bb82d2374d37d9b118dfdf6a3c1bc5d65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759013874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057850/d39b165bb82d2374d37d9b118dfdf6a3c1bc5d65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759013874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General Mature Content: Refers to content dealing with mature topics that may not be appropriate for all audiences"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Private Witch Eye: The Lotus Killer&quot; is a fan